Liferay-Releng-App-Description: Porygon is a minimalistic theme inspired by existing digital magazine. It provides a solid foundation to get started with your magazine. Porygon introduces only the necessary overhead, allowing you to easily build your custom experiences on top of it.<br /><br />The Porygon theme includes these useful features:<ul><li>Different ways to show the content preview, cards and lists in different number of columns and a carousel.</li><li>16 entry examples with big photos.</li>
Liferay-Releng-App-Title: ${liferay.releng.app.title.prefix} Porygon
